{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大字保留了人物处境、原因和疑问之间的关系，单看大字也能理解每屏在讲什么；X放大的多是孤立关键词，理解关系需要依赖小字。small：Y的感受能补充身体体验，旁注又提供音乐线索，层次比较清楚。core：Y把怀念归属与不愿再受委屈之间的反复拉扯放在了大字层面，全曲的行动方向也更容易看清。concise：X略好，Y在S05、S06、S12、S13有几处感受重复大字已经表达的抵抗、卸下防备和向前行动。human：Y略好，X有“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”“心里的愿望向远方发出”等抽象或搭配不够自然的表达；Y虽然也有个别修饰过度的句子，整体更接近日常表达。fine：Y更好地把体验落在具体的身体感受和心理反应上，如胸口堵塞、指尖发颤、脚掌用力蹬地；X有较多直接描述旋律、和弦和音乐变化的内容。load：Y的大块数量适中，通常按自然意群逐步出现，且与停留时间基本相称；X虽然大字更少，但关键词分布较碎，需要在多个局部之间跳读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad9d919d-0b27-455e-8a46-06f0e40ef147", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T203929482723Z", "elapsed_seconds": 330.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:44:59.998260+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "08983b3d3e1789df7c7fe48b01e1394ba4c05483a210eec4be16fef814576ce5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp